Package: Triangulator
Type: Package
Title: A Reserving Companion App for Quick Claims Analysis
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Mark", "Sheridan", email = "176624331+MarkSheridanFSAI@users.noreply.github.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A point-and-click 'shiny' app for exploring insurance claims data.
    Upload a claims listing or bordereaux and get data checks, summaries by
    group, claim size bands, claims development triangles with drill-down to
    individual claims, development patterns, first-look chain-ladder reserve
    estimates and reserve ranges using Mack's method. Designed for people who
    are not actuaries or programmers.
